<%# Rule 14 / D62 h7: say WHY names are hidden and WHEN they appear, so a client never reads the
    numbering as missing data. Staff see nothing here. %>
<% if board.visibility.blind? %>
  <div class="report-notice report-notice--info" role="note">
    <i class="fa fa-user-secret" aria-hidden="true"></i>
    <p>Applicant names and contacts are masked (Candidate 01, 02, …) until the gate decision is confirmed, that is when
      <%= board.gated? ? "CV screening and the technical test are closed" : "CV screening is closed" %>. The candidate numbers are the same as on the vacancy home page.</p>
  </div>
<% end %>
